        {
          "name": "Create book",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n  \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n  \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n  \"supplierCountry\": \"US\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea un libro en el inventario.\n\n**Body**\n- `title` (string, requerido)\n- `author` (string, requerido)\n- `isbn` (string, requerido): único, no puede repetirse\n- `costUsd` (number, requerido): máximo 2 decimales, no negativo\n- `stockQuantity` (entero, requerido): no negativo\n- `category` (string, requerido)\n- `supplierCountry` (string, requerido)\n\nLos campos no listados se ignoran.\n\n**Respuestas**\n- `201 Created`: `{ id }` del libro creado.\n- `400 BAD_REQUEST`: body inválido.\n- `400 BOOK-E-001`: ya existe un libro con ese ISBN."
          },
          "response": [
